Query the IP address that is set for the remote tunnel end.  This
is  the  address  the  encapsulated packets are sent to (i.e. the
real address of the remote tunnel endpoint.)  Set  the  operation
mode  to the specified IP protocol value.  The protocol is passed
to the interface in  (struct  ifreq)‐>ifr_flags.   The  operation
mode  can also be given as IPPROTO_UDP IPPROTO_GRE IPPROTO_MOBILE
to Query operation mode.  Delegate a socket from  userland  to  a
tunnel  interface in UDP encapsulation mode.  The file descriptor
for the socket is passed in (struct ifreq)‐>ifr_value.  Note that
the IP addresses of the tunnel endpoints may be the same  as  the
ones  defined  with for the interface (as if IP is encapsulated),
but need not be, as e.g. when encapsulating AppleTalk.   Configu‐
