The  kernel  must be set to forward datagrams by either option in
the kernel config file or by issuing the appropriate option to  A
description of GRE encapsulation can be found in RFC 1701 and RFC
1702.   A description of MOBILE encapsulation can be found in RFC
2004.  The GRE RFCs are not yet fully  implemented  (no  GRE  op‐
tions).   The  MOBILE  encapsulation  appears to have been broken
since it was first added to until August 2006.  It  is  known  to
interoperate  with  another  in  MOBILE mode, however, it has not
been tested for interoperability with any other implementation of
RFC 2004.  The base system does not contain a daemon for automat‐
ically establishing a UDP tunnel between  a  host  behind  a  NAT
router and a host on the Internet.
